|CKB              Stage 1 of 8: Your First Minutes|XX0
|WKO=====================================================================
|YKOA short tutorial starts automatically for new characters and teaches
looking, moving, gear, and safe combat. Darkflow shows it in a hover window.
Type |YKBtutorial|YKO to see your current step and
|YKBtutorial continue|YKO to continue in any client.

Learn to look at everything (|YKBlook <thing>|YKO), check your
|YKBinventory|YKO, and read your |YKBscore|YKO. If you ever get lost,
|YKBncot|YKO returns you to the Center of Town, and the Newbie Tome
Dispenser there (|YKBpull lever|YKO, |YKBread tome|YKO) holds the town
directions.

Make the interface work for you before you roam. |YKBset list|YKO shows your
saved options. Useful first choices are |YKBset autoexits on|YKO for named
exits, |YKBset npcdetail on|YKO for NPC levels, and
|YKBset itemdetail on|YKO for raw weapon and armour ratings. Use
|YKBmonitor bar|YKO for live HP/SP. If you use a screenreader, run
|YKBset screenreader on|YKO to enable screenreader-friendly output.|XX0

